s/a8ea19c62d77f1f4eac3a2cf35a74e6e.mp4?t=1719836078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Man your shuttle, land on pit stations, explore remnants of other abandoned, lifeless spaceships where no human life is left but android and robots are guarding them for years following the demise of their masters. These machines are fierce and ruthless, be quick, be careful, collect your loot and don\u2019t look behind!<br><br>You need to mend your ship, you need to craft your tools, you need to obtain sustenance and most importantly you need to survive until you find the last Hyper Station\u2026",
